WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:04.758
Markets express demand through searches, saves, and purchases.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.448
Molly begins with the need, before the team decides what to say.

00:11.050 --> 00:18.034
From one vague thought, Molly maps how a person may search and compare,
then sends each step into live validation.

00:19.400 --> 00:25.856
Fresh source posts test each step.
Here, 120 notes became five supported opportunities.

00:27.000 --> 00:32.160
Molly identifies the change she wants:
a small ritual that switches work off.

00:33.750 --> 00:40.134
That becomes a precise content job:
create one scene that lets her feel the evening begin.

00:41.450 --> 00:45.986
Reading, saving, store, and purchase outcomes return to the next cycle.

00:46.300 --> 00:49.804
Copy is the output. The product is the loop.
